  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Support to the Robert Carr Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UK Support to the Robert Carr Fund is a component of UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;7,000,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): STD control including HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
